It is:
👉 A microservices-based e-commerce app

User flow:

User → Frontend → Product Catalog → Cart → Redis

Later (advanced):

Frontend → Checkout → Payment / Shipping / Email



Before deploying any application:

I must understand:
- language used
- port used
- dependencies
- environment variables
- service communication


What to check:
1. Language

Look for:

package.json → Node.js
.go files → Go    (port is defined either in main.go file or the server.go file)
requirements.txt → Python

Without this, Kubernetes becomes confusing.

